thing well.\n\nCLOSING RULE:\n  The closing sentence must derive from something specific in this guest's review — the occasion, the dish, their frequency, their own words.\n  Never close with a generic formula. Never repeat a specific noun already used in the opening.\n\nRETURN the complete draft as plain text only — no JSON, no preamble, no explanation.\nStart with the opening sentence exactly as provided, then continue the response.\nLANGUAGE: If the LANGUAGE field in the user prompt is \"es\", write the entire response in Spanish. Apply all tier, tone, brand voice, and governance rules in Spanish. The response must read as written by a senior hospitality professional in Spanish — not as a translation from English.`\n\nconst body_user_prompt =\n`OPENING SENTENCE (use exactly as line 1):\\n${opening_sentence}\\n\\n` +\n`RESPONSE TIER: ${inp.confirmed_response_tier}\\n` +\n`TONE STYLE: ${inp.tone_style}\\n` +\n`LANGUAGE: ${inp.lang_resolved}\\n\\n` +\n`BRAND VOICE BRIEF:\\n` +\n` Tone descriptors: ${bv.tone_descriptors}\\n` +\n` Formality level: ${bv.formality_level} / 5\\n` +\n` Person preference: ${bv.person_preference}\\n` +\n` Include phrases: ${bv.brand_phrases_include || 'none specified'}\\n` +\n` Avoid phrases: ${bv.brand_phrases_avoid || 'none specified'}\\n` +\n` Vocabulary restrictions: ${bv.vocabulary_restrictions || 'none'}\\n\\n` +\n`RESPONSE STRATEGY:\\n` +\n` Emotional axis: ${inp.emotional_axis}\\n` +\n` Pain axis: ${inp.pain_axis}\\n` +\n` Stability axis: ${inp.stability_axis}\\n` +\n` Signal-Based Consideration: ${inp.signal_based_consideration}\\n` +\n` Solution type: ${inp.solution_type}\\n\\n` +\n`SIGNAL DETAIL:\\n` +\n` Emotion hypothesis: ${inp.emotion_hypothesis || 'Not available'}\\n` +\n` Keywords: ${inp.keywords || 'Not available'}\\n\\n` +\n(inp.behavioral_interpretation ? `BEHAVIORAL CONTEXT: ${inp.behavioral_interpretation}\\n\\n` : '') +\n`Complete the response. Return plain text only. Start with the opening sentence.`;\n\nconst body_p